##Tipo & classe##

<div class="example terminal" >
&lt;!DOCTYPE html>
&lt;html>
&lt;head>
  &lt;title>Seletores&lt;/title>
  &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" type="text/css">
  &lt;style>
      <span class=focus>p.</span>important { background: orange; }           
      .important { color: red; }
  &lt;/style>
&lt;/head>
&lt;body>
    <span class=focus>&lt;<u>p class=important</u>> Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, ...&lt;/p></span>
    &lt;p> Praesent vel elementum nunc...  &lt;/p>
    &lt;p> Donec <span class=focus>&lt;span <u>class=important</u>>cursus&lt;span></span> orci ...  &lt;/p></span>
&lt;/body>
&lt;/html>
</div>


* Classe pode ser restrita a um determinado tipo
* Seletor combina tipo e classe, separados por **ponto** <span class=focus>.</span>